<p>Increases weapon damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66%</acronym> and Physical Power by 30 when using steamguns.</p><p>When your bullets hit a target you instinctively reach out to the impact and use the kinetic force to project a mindstar attack doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">150%, 183%, 209%, 230%, 250%</acronym> damage (guaranteed hit), if you wield one in the offhand.</p><p>This projection requires a pure mindstar; it will not work if extended into a psiblade.</p><p></p><p>Also activable for a shot that deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">134%, 153%, 167%, 179%, 190%</acronym> weapon damage as mind damage.</p>